{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTListCorner","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTListCorner","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaGeneral"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_map_const_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_map_const_mul","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L159-L164","doc":"Pull a constant out of a list sum-of-map: `∑ (A · f c) = A · ∑ f c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.getD_pos_of_corner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.getD_pos_of_corner","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L153-L157","doc":"A removable corner of a positive shape has positive row length, so `removeCorner` shrinks `sz`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.mem_corners","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.mem_corners","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L147-L151","doc":"Membership in `corners l` is exactly being a removable corner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.corners","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.corners","kind":"def","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L143-L145","doc":"The removable corners of `l`, as the list of row indices `i` with `IsCorner l i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.prodHooks_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.prodHooks_pos","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L125-L141","doc":"**The hook product is positive** on a weakly-decreasing positive shape: every cell `(i, j)` with\n`j < λ_i` has hook `(λ_i − j) + (colLen j − i) − 1 ≥ 1`, since `λ_i − j ≥ 1` and `colLen j > i` (the\ncolumn through an existing cell is at least `i + 1` tall, by `colLen_duality`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.list_prod_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.list_prod_pos","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L118-L123","doc":"A list of positive naturals has positive product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removeCorner_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removeCorner_pos","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L108-L114","doc":"**`removeCorner` is positive** — every surviving row has length `≥ 1` (zeros were filtered out). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sorted_removeCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sorted_removeCorner","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L103-L106","doc":"**`removeCorner` preserves weak decrease** (filtering a sorted list keeps it sorted). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sorted_set_corner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sorted_set_corner","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L72-L101","doc":"**Decrementing a removable corner preserves weak decrease.**  The new length `l[i]−1` still sits\nbetween its neighbours: `l[i−1] ≥ l[i] ≥ l[i]−1` and `l[i]−1 ≥ l[i+1]` (the latter because a corner has\n`l[i+1] < l[i]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.getD_eq_getElem'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.getD_eq_getElem'","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L67-L70","doc":"`l.getD i 0 = l[i]` for a genuine index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sz_removeCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sz_removeCorner","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L60-L65","doc":"**`removeCorner` drops the cell count by one** at any genuine row with a positive length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_set_decr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_set_decr","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L46-L58","doc":"Decrementing the length of a genuine row drops the total cell count by one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_filter_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.sum_filter_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L36-L44","doc":"Filtering out zeros leaves the sum unchanged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removeCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removeCorner","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L30-L34","doc":"Remove one cell from the end of row `i`: decrement that row's length, then drop the row entirely\nif it has shrunk to `0` (which, for a removable corner of a weakly-decreasing positive shape, happens\nonly when `i` is the final length-`1` row). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.instDecidableIsCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.instDecidableIsCorner","kind":"instance","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L27-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.IsCorner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.IsCorner","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTListCorner.lean#L21-L25","doc":"Row index `i` is a **removable corner** of shape `l`: a genuine row whose last cell is an outer\ncorner, i.e. the next row is strictly shorter (treating \"beyond the last row\" as length `0`).  For a\nweakly-decreasing positive shape this is exactly the set of cells whose deletion leaves a shape. ","signatureChunk":0}]}